  "title": "Mushroom Stuffing",
  "description": "Fresh mushrooms are sauteed in butter with onions and celery before adding to a mixture of bread cubes, chopped apple, parsley, beaten egg and broth. This recipe will stuff a 12 pound turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "CHRISTYJ"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-11-24T13:57:13-05:00",
